# A Borg sphere on layouts/borg-move.jsonc gets a move order: the dumps show its 3D velocity (vel=, the height included),
# pitch= and roll= at 0.00 throughout, and its yaw turning toward the order's bearing plus a random quarter turn. Two runs
# at one frame rate write identical dumps.
# Run it with --layout layouts/borg-move.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
# The point is in the frame of the dump's pos= field, whose z is the layout z mirrored.
wait 1
select Sphere
wait 0.3
move 2300 -2300
wait 2
dump driving
fast-forward until Sphere move = none max 40
dump arrived
